    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46067" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζᾱής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζα-, ἄημι</span>) 
